  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced deterministic build and SourceLink support for better CI/CD traceability.\n\t\t\t- Optimized cryptographic engines with Span-first design and AEAD envelope support.\n\t\t\t- Added Randomization.Core with Xoshiro-based PRNG (XoshiroFallback) and reseed scheduling.\n\t\t\t- Improved TaskManager with async-safe cancellation and lightweight scheduling.\n\t\t\t- Enhanced Identity and Injection subsystems for performance and modularity.\n\t\t\t- General cleanup, updated documentation, and improved unit test coverage.",
